# Everything this site needs. Set real values in the Vercel dashboard, never in a file.
#
# Mail is SMTP through a mailbox the client already owns (glaze.md: never a
# hosted mail API the client has to pay for). Until Ruin the Party has its own
# mailbox, the sending account can be a glazedweb.com one; the message carries
# the visitor's address as reply-to either way, so client DNS is never on the
# critical path.
#
# SMTP_HOST      e.g. smtp.gmail.com, smtp.office365.com, or the mailbox host.
# SMTP_PORT      587 (STARTTLS) or 465 (TLS). Defaults to 587.
# SMTP_USER      The mailbox login.
# SMTP_PASS      Its password or app password.
# CONTACT_TO     Where contact-form messages land: the client's own address.
#                It is never shown on a page (his call); this is the only
#                place it lives.
# CONTACT_FROM   Optional. Defaults to "Ruin the Party Website <SMTP_USER>".
# TEAMS_TO       Optional. Where the Teams page's requests land (the page
#                shows jon@cruzconsultants.com). Defaults to CONTACT_TO.
#
# The shop runs on Stripe Checkout (hosted). It opens only when BOTH the key
# and SHOP_OPEN=1 are set; until then the store is built but switched off,
# and the buy button says so honestly. Redeploy after changing either.
#
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY   The client's own Stripe secret key (sk_test_... to try it).
# SHOP_OPEN           1 to open the store. Set it only once the real prices
#                     are in src/data/shop.ts; the key alone would charge the
#                     placeholder prices.
# SITE_URL            Optional. The origin Stripe returns to after checkout.
#                     Defaults to the request origin.
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET  Signing secret of the Stripe webhook endpoint
#                     (Developers > Webhooks > Add endpoint, URL
#                     https://ruintheparty.com/api/stripe-webhook, event
#                     checkout.session.completed). Each paid order is emailed.
# ORDER_TO            Where order emails land. Defaults to CONTACT_TO.
SMTP_HOST=
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASS=
CONTACT_TO=
CONTACT_FROM=
TEAMS_TO=
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
SHOP_OPEN=
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
ORDER_TO=
SITE_URL=
